file=Legal & Compliance/shield/operational/agent/shield-config.md · h=agent: shield\ndepartment: Legal & Compliance\ntype: config\npurpose: >\nInsurance table, escalation matrix, response-deadline alert thresholds, review\ncadence, litigation-hold policy, work-product header. Read by dispute-log for\njurisdiction scope, deadline thresholds, insurance notification requirements,\nand exposure escalation triggers.\nrequired_by:\n- custom/dispute-log/SKILL.md\nlast_updated: 2026-07-29\n · s·c:shield \· config=> Fill each `<FILL_IN>` with a real value or `n/a — <reason>`. Section headings are contract with `dispute-log` — do not rename.\n · tb=\| Field \| Value \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Role of operator \| `<FILL_IN — lawyer / paralegal / non-lawyer>` \| · tb=\| Litigation-department head \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| General Counsel \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Jurisdiction \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| `<FILL_IN — e.g., US-federal>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| `<FILL_IN — e.g., US-CA>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · jis:Jurisdictions in scope=No hardcoded jurisdiction (§0.4b).\n · tb=\| Policy type \| Carrier \| Policy number \| Coverage limit \| Notice-required within \| Retention \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| D&O \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., 60 days>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| E&O / Professional \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Cyber \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Employment Practices Liability \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Commercial General Liability \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · ip:Insurance policies=Any active dispute that potentially triggers coverage but has `insurance_notified: no` is a defect flagged on every attestation.\n · tb=\| Practice area \| Firm \| Rate range \| Matter-approval threshold \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Commercial litigation \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., $10K matter-cap without further approval>` \| · tb=\| Employment litigation \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| IP litigation \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Regulatory / enforcement \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Insurance-coverage \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Level \| Threshold \| Approver \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| L1 \| Log-only \· routine update \| shield itself \| No external sign-off \| · tb=\| L2 \| New dispute \· exposure > `<FILL_IN $X>` \· settlement discussion \· counsel engagement \| `<FILL_IN — GC or role>` \| Business-unit or GC review \| · tb=\| L3 \| Exposure > `<FILL_IN $Y>` OR class-action OR regulatory-enforcement OR any dispute-type in "always-L3" list below OR any overdue response deadline OR pattern of ≥ 3 overdues in a quarter \| `Governance/board` \| Fixed \| · adt:Always-L3 dispute types=Auto-escalate to `Governance/board` regardless of exposure:\n\n- class-action / mass-arbitration\n- regulatory-enforcement (SEC / FTC / state AG / non-US equivalent)\n- criminal investigation (of the company or an officer)\n- injunctive-relief sought (preliminary or permanent)\n- IP litigation with ≥ `<FILL_IN>` exposure or seeking injunction against product\n- employment class or PAGA-style representative action\n\nAdd or remove per operator's risk posture.\n · tb=\| Tier \| Days-to-deadline \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| 🔴 Overdue \| past 0 \| · tb=\| 🟠 Critical \| ≤ 7 \| · tb=\| 🟡 Warning \| ≤ 14 \| · tb=\| 🟢 Informational \| ≤ 30 \| · rat:Response-deadline alert thresholds=Cadence for the deadline-review scheduled task: `<FILL_IN — daily recommended>`.\n · tb=\| Cycle \| Cadence \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Dispute-portfolio attestation (Step 4) \| `<FILL_IN — quarterly>` \| · tb=\| Exposure re-estimation (rerun case-assessment) \| `<FILL_IN — every 90 days per dispute>` \| · tb=\| Insurance-notification audit \| `<FILL_IN — at every quarterly review>` \| · tb=\| Field \| Value \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Standard trigger \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., "receipt of demand letter or reasonable anticipation of litigation">` \| · tb=\| Hold-notice template \| `<FILL_IN — path or slug>` \| · tb=\| Retention duration for closed disputes \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., "7 years post-final judgment / settlement">` \| · tb=\| Data preservation scope \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., "email, Slack, Drive, custom database records, backups">` \| · tb=\| Field \| Value \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Work-product header (default) \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., "PRIVILEGED AND CONFIDENTIAL — ATTORNEY WORK PRODUCT — PREPARED IN ANTICIPATION OF LITIGATION">` \| · tb=\| Privilege circle (default distribution) \| `<FILL_IN>` \| · tb=\| Preferred citation style \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., Bluebook>` \| · tb=\| Exposure notation format \| `<FILL_IN — e.g., "USD, low-mid-high range">` \| · tb=\| Section \| Fields \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Who's using this \| 3 \| · tb=\| Jurisdictions in scope \| ≥1 required \| · tb=\| Insurance policies \| 5 policies × 5 fields \| · tb=\| External counsel panel \| 5 × 4 fields \| · tb=\| Escalation matrix \| 3 fields \| · tb=\| Always-L3 list \| 1 optional customisation \| · tb=\| Response-deadline cadence \| 1 \| · tb=\| Review cadence \| 3 \| · tb=\| Litigation-hold policy \| 4 \| · tb=\| House style \| 4 \| · cds:Config debt summary=All `<FILL_IN>` announced per §14.7.\n